{"sha": "636d6e9dc25d4dc913650b0e656a16ac8cfe170f0c64d278ef928bdfe90e13bb", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:integration} 章 --- 线段上的积分}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:integration:1}", "$\\dfrac{1}{x^2-4} = \\dfrac{1/4}{x - 2} - \\dfrac{1/4}{x+2}$", "（遮挡法），于是", "\\[", "\\int_0^1 \\frac{\\dd x}{x^2 - 4}", "= \\frac14\\Bigl[\\ln\\abs{x-2} - \\ln\\abs{x+2}\\Bigr]_0^1", "= \\frac14\\Bigl(\\ln\\frac{1}{3} - \\ln 1\\Bigr) = -\\frac{\\ln 3}{4}.", "\\]", "", "用分部积分（$u' = 1$，$v = \\ln t$）：$\\int_1^{\\eu} \\ln t\\,\\dd t =", "\\bigl[t\\ln t\\bigr]_1^{\\eu} - \\int_1^{\\eu} \\dd t = \\eu - (\\eu - 1) =", "1$。", "", "用分部积分（$u' = \\sin t$，$v = t$）：$\\int_0^\\pi t\\sin t\\,\\dd t =", "\\bigl[-t\\cos t\\bigr]_0^\\pi + \\int_0^\\pi \\cos t\\,\\dd t = \\pi + 0 =", "\\pi$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:integration:2}", "作代换 $u = t^2 + 1$，$\\dd u = 2t\\,\\dd t$：", "\\[", "\\int_0^1 \\frac{t\\,\\dd t}{(t^2+1)^2}", "= \\frac12 \\int_1^2 \\frac{\\dd u}{u^2}", "= \\frac12\\Bigl[-\\frac1u\\Bigr]_1^2 = \\frac14 .", "\\]", "令 $u = \\sin t$：$\\int_0^{\\pi/2} \\cos^3 t\\,\\dd t = \\int_0^{\\pi/2}", "(1 - \\sin^2 t)\\cos t\\,\\dd t = \\bigl[\\sin t - \\frac{\\sin^3", "t}{3}\\bigr]_0^{\\pi/2} = 1 - \\frac13 = \\frac23$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:integration:3}", "$u_n = \\dfrac1n \\sum_{k=1}^{n} \\dfrac{1}{1 + (k/n)^2}$ 是", "$x \\mapsto \\frac{1}{1+x^2}$ 在 $\\intcc{0}{1}$ 上的黎曼和，于是 $u_n \\to", "\\int_0^1 \\frac{\\dd x}{1+x^2} = \\arctan 1 = \\dfrac\\pi4$。", "", "$\\ln v_n = \\dfrac1n \\sum_{k=1}^{n} \\ln\\dfrac{n+k}{n} = \\dfrac 1n", "\\sum_{k=1}^n \\ln\\Bigl(1 + \\dfrac kn\\Bigr) \\to \\int_0^1 \\ln(1+x)\\,\\dd", "x = \\bigl[(1+x)\\ln(1+x) - x\\bigr]_0^1 = 2\\ln 2 - 1$。于是 $v_n \\to", "\\eu^{2\\ln 2 - 1} = \\dfrac 4\\eu$。（检验此恒等式：", "$\\frac{(2n)!}{n!\\,n^n} = \\prod_{k=1}^{n} \\frac{n+k}{n}$。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:integration:4}", "极限为 $0$。设 $M = \\sup \\abs f$ 且 $\\varepsilon \\in", "\\intoo{0}{1}$。在 $1 - \\varepsilon$ 处分段：", "\\[", "\\Bigl| \\int_0^1 x^n f \\Bigr|", "\\leq \\int_0^{1 - \\varepsilon} x^n \\abs f + \\int_{1-\\varepsilon}^1", "x^n \\abs f", "\\leq M\\,(1-\\varepsilon)^n + M\\varepsilon .", "\\]", "由于 $(1 - \\varepsilon)^n \\to 0$（见\\cref{exo:b1:seq:3}），左边的上极限", "$\\leq M\\varepsilon$ 对每个 $\\varepsilon$ 都成立：", "故积分趋于 $0$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:integration:5}", "$Q(\\lambda) = \\int_a^b (f + \\lambda g)^2 = \\int f^2 + 2\\lambda \\int", "fg + \\lambda^2 \\int g^2 \\geq 0$ 对所有 $\\lambda$ 成立。若 $\\int g^2 =", "0$，则 $g = 0$（严格正性，", "\\cref{thm:b1:integration:props}~(4)），于是不等式为 $0 \\leq", "0$。否则 $Q$ 是真正的二次多项式，处处 $\\geq 0$，其", "判别式 $\\leq 0$，即 $\\bigl(\\int fg\\bigr)^2 \\leq \\int", "f^2 \\int g^2$。", "", "等号成立当且仅当判别式为零，亦即 $Q(\\lambda_0) = 0$ 对某个", "$\\lambda_0$，即 $\\int (f + \\lambda_0 g)^2 = 0$，亦即（再由严格正性", "）$f = -\\lambda_0 g$，故", "等号成立当且仅当 $f$ 与 $g$ 成比例。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:integration:6}", "设 $\\Phi(a) = \\int_a^{a+T} f$。由微积分基本定理", "（\\cref{thm:b1:integration:ftc}），$\\Phi$ 可导，且", "$\\Phi'(a) = f(a + T) - f(a) = 0$，故为常数。", "", "对 $x > 0$，记 $x = nT + r$，$0 \\leq r < T$（$n = \\lfloor x/T", "\\rfloor$）。由沙勒关系：", "\\[", "\\int_0^x f = n \\int_0^T f + \\int_{nT}^{nT + r} f,", "\\qquad", "\\Bigl| \\int_{nT}^{nT+r} f \\Bigr| \\leq T \\sup_{\\intcc{0}{T}} \\abs f", "= C .", "\\]", "于是 $\\frac 1x \\int_0^x f = \\frac{nT}{x}\\cdot\\frac 1T \\int_0^T f +", "O\\bigl(\\frac 1x\\bigr)$，且 $\\frac{nT}{x} \\to 1$，极限为", "$\\frac1T \\int_0^T f$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:integration:7}", "设 $g(x) = f(x) - x$，它连续，且", "\\[", "\\int_0^1 g = \\int_0^1 f - \\frac12 = 0 .", "\\]", "若 $g$ 处处不为零，则由介值定理，", "必保持定号（区间上同时取两种符号的连续函数必有零点）；", "不妨设 $g > 0$。再由严格正性", "（\\cref{thm:b1:integration:props}~(4)，对 $g > 0$ 应用，得", "$\\int g > 0$），与 $\\int g = 0$ 矛盾。故 $g(c) = 0$ 对某个", "$c$，即 $f(c) = c$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:integration:8}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 用分部积分，取 $u' = \\sin t$，$v = \\sin^{n-1} t$：", "        \\[", "        W_n = \\bigl[-\\cos t\\sin^{n-1}t\\bigr]_0^{\\pi/2}", "        + (n-1)\\int_0^{\\pi/2} \\cos^2 t\\,\\sin^{n-2} t\\,\\dd t", "        = (n-1)(W_{n-2} - W_n),", "        \\]", "        于是 $nW_n = (n-1)W_{n-2}$。由 $W_0 = \\frac\\pi2$，$W_1 = 1$：", "        \\[", "        W_{2p} = \\frac{(2p-1)(2p-3)\\cdots 1}{(2p)(2p-2)\\cdots 2}\\,", "        \\frac{\\pi}{2} = \\frac{(2p)!}{4^p (p!)^2}\\,\\frac\\pi2,", "        \\qquad", "        W_{2p+1} = \\frac{(2p)(2p-2)\\cdots 2}{(2p+1)(2p-1)\\cdots 3}", "        = \\frac{4^p (p!)^2}{(2p+1)!} .", "        \\]", "  \\item 在 $\\intoo{0}{\\frac\\pi2}$ 上，$0 < \\sin t < 1$，故 $\\sin^{n+1} <", "        \\sin^n$，$(W_n)$ 严格递减且为正。", "        由递推关系作夹逼：", "        \\[", "        \\frac{n}{n+1} = \\frac{W_{n+1}}{W_{n-1}}", "        \\leq \\frac{W_{n+1}}{W_n} \\leq 1", "        \\quad\\implies\\quad \\frac{W_{n+1}}{W_n} \\to 1 .", "        \\]", "        不变量 $a_n = (n+1)W_{n+1}W_n$ 满足 $a_n = a_{n-1}$，", "        由递推关系 $(n+1)W_{n+1} = nW_{n-1}$，故 $a_n = a_0 =", "        1 \\cdot W_1 W_0 = \\frac\\pi2$。于是", "        \\[", "        n W_n^2 \\sim (n+1) W_{n+1} W_n = \\frac\\pi2", "        \\quad\\implies\\quad", "        W_n \\sim \\sqrt{\\frac{\\pi}{2n}} .", "        \\]", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", ""]}